{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21041.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story02","nameNarration":"青叶知花","narration":"我决定到店里买一件泳衣。","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21041.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"narration":"起因是，静香小姐要回老家，@我们大家约好@陪她一起去……"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_13141.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102501,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102701,"motion":0,"pos":1},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102601,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"blackFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":102701,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"沙绪","textCenter":"那里有可以在河边玩水的地方，@最好带上泳衣哦。","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.3,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102501},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102601},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102701}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":300,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"青叶知花","textCenter":"泳衣……吗？"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21041.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"nameNarration":"青叶知花","narration":"我把这件事告诉父母后，@他们从并不宽裕的家用里，@拿出了钱，让我去买泳衣……","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21041.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"青叶知花","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"（这笔钱……@绝对不能浪费！）"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_21411.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"rollIn"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"青叶知花","textCenter":"唔……款式比想象的还多，@真难选呢。","turnChangeOut":"rollOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"青叶知花","textCenter":"（这种时候，就打电话@请人给些建议吧。）"},{"nameNarration":"","narration":"[surround:7105_telphone]～～♪～～♪","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21411.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"bg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":0,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"thinking"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"……嗯嗯，原来如此！@所以才来找在下商量……","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"沙沙——……","narrationBg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"咦……旭小姐？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（听不见了……@这里的信号可能不太好。）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"……喂，旭小姐？@听得见吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"……啊，虽然有点听不清，@不过没问题！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"您想商量的……@是水下装备的事吧！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"咦……啊，是的。@……也可以这么说吧。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"听说时女村落除了以前@举行裳着仪式的地方以外，"},{"chara":[{"id":304701}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"还有一处瀑布，@很适合当作[textRed:游玩的地方]……"},{"bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701},{"id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"沙……沙沙……","narrationBg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"bgm":"bgm23_tokime03","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","narrationEffect":"out","textRight":"啊，刚才那句@听得有些不清楚，"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"是说那处瀑布，@很适合当作[textRed:打猎的地方]吗？"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"青叶知花","narration":"后来才知道，@我和旭小姐之间的误会，@似乎就是从这里开始的。","narrationBg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"旭","narrationEffect":"out","textRight":"（原来如此，也就是说，@要在瀑布下的水潭里抓鱼……）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"（能为生存高手出谋划策，@真是荣幸！）"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"……瀑布下的水潭，@即使在夏天，水温也相当低。"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"所以，潜水服@是必不可少的。"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"至于工具，果然还是用@知花阁下擅长的鱼叉吧？"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"[chara:304701:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]请、请等一下。@我不潜水，也不用鱼叉哦？"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"听说，只是在水边玩的话，@那里还是很安全的……"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"motion":0},{"id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"沙……沙沙……","narrationBg":"bg_adv_narration.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"（又有杂音了……）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"……哎呀，失礼了。@[chara:103401:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:103401:lipSynch_1][chara:103401:cheek_0][chara:103401:face_mtn_ex_050.exp3.json]嗯嗯，要在安全的水边捕鱼……"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"是用撒网吗？@还是设鱼梁捕鱼？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（怎么还是误会了……！？）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"……对、对不起，@我说的不是抓鱼的事。"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"啊……失礼了！@原来是在下大大误会了。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103401,"lipSynch":0,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"（……知花阁下的目标，@原来是水边的小动物啊。）"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"（光是立刻能想到的，@就有甲鱼、河虾、青蛙等等，）"},{"chara":[{"id":103401,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"（生活在那里、可以食用的生物，@种类可多了。）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"……不好意思，@刚才我的声音很难听清吧。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"不不，是在下@太早下结论了！"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"说到在水边活动，@首先果然还是……"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"要考虑怎样兼顾@行动轻便与防护性。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"即使在深山里，@夏天也很炎热啊。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"啊，原来如此……"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（也就是选分体泳衣，@还是连体泳衣的问题吧。）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"会不会在灌木丛之类的地方，@埋伏等待猎物呢？"},{"chara":[{"id":304701,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"埋伏……@一般应该不会吧……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"说得也是。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"那么，相比防护性，@在下认为可以优先考虑轻便。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"嗯嗯，轻便优先……@那我就选分体的吧。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"另外还要考虑的，@就是伪装能力。"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"融入周围的环境，@也是非常重要的。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"……啊，的确！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（要是和静香小姐她们的泳衣@差得太远，也会不好意思……）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"果然，最常见的还是@以绿色为主的迷彩图案。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"嗯嗯，绿色最常见……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"要是和自然环境融为一体，@就有被误射的危险，"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"所以在冬季的狩猎期，@绝对要避开这种图案。"},{"chara":[{"id":103401}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"不过，夏季会严格禁猎，@就不用担心这些了。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"……？@[wait:2][chara:304701:lipSynch_1]好、好的……我不会在冬天穿的……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103401,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"旭","textRight":"再用藤蔓等植物伪装一下，@就完美了。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"[chara:304701:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]藤、藤蔓……！？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（好像找不到@那样的泳衣呢……）"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"青叶知花","textLeft":"（她是说，用花朵之类的配饰@来装点一下比较好吗……？）"},{"autoTurnLast":1,"bg":"bg_adv_21411.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":304701,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":304701}],"nameCenter":"青叶知花","textCenter":"绿色的分体泳衣……@再加上花朵配饰……","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"bg":"bg_adv_21821.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102551,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102750,"motion":1,"pos":1},